### ==============================================================================
### COLLEGE PLACEMENT & RECRUITMENT PORTAL - REST CLIENT REQUESTS
### ==============================================================================
### Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or any HTTP test runner.
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### Set your JWT tokens here after logging in:
@adminToken = your_placement_officer_token_here
@recruiterToken = your_company_recruiter_token_here
@studentToken = your_student_token_here

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. HEALTH CHECKS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Root Welcome
GET http://localhost:5000/

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. AUTHENTICATION & COMPANY ONBOARDING
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1. Register a new Company (Recruiter) - Registers with is_approved = false
# @name registerCompany
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Acme Tech Solutions",
  "email": "hr@acmetech.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "role": "recruiter"
}

### 2. Attempt Company Login BEFORE Approval (Should return 403 Forbidden)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hr@acmetech.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### 3. Login Placement Officer (Admin - default seeded account)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@portal.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### 4. Register a Student (Auto-approved)
# @name registerStudent
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rahul Sharma",
  "email": "rahul.sharma@college.edu",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "role": "student"
}

### 5. Login Student
# @name loginStudent
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "rahul.sharma@college.edu",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### 6. Get Current Authenticated Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. PLACEMENT OFFICER (ADMIN) APPROVALS & VERIFICATION
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### View All Companies Pending Approval
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/recruiters/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Approve a Company Recruiter (Use recruiter's user id)
@pendingRecruiterId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/recruiters/{{pendingRecruiterId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Verify Student Academic Profile (Use student user_id or profile id)
@studentIdToVerify = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/students/{{studentIdToVerify}}/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### View All Placed Students (Placements report)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/placements
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### View Comprehensive Placement Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### View All Registered Users
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. STUDENT ACADEMIC PROFILE (Role: student)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Get Student Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Complete Student Profile (Required before applying)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/students/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roll_number": "2022CS1042",
  "course": "B.Tech",
  "department": "Computer Science & Engineering",
  "current_year": 4,
  "graduation_year": 2026,
  "cgpa": 8.75,
  "backlogs": 0,
  "phone": "+91-9876543210",
  "skills": "Java, Python, Node.js, Express, PostgreSQL, Git",
  "resume_url": "https://example.com/resumes/rahul-sharma.pdf"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. CAMPUS JOBS & PLACEMENT DRIVES (Recruiter & Public)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### View All Active Campus Drives (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs

### Filter Drives by Keyword, Location, and Job Type (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs?search=Software&location=Bangalore&job_type=Full-time

### Get Company's Own Posted Drives (Role: recruiter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/my/list
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}

### Post a New Campus Drive with Eligibility Criteria (Role: approved recruiter)
# @name createJob
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Graduate Software Engineer (Campus Drive)",
  "company": "Acme Tech Solutions",
  "description": "Hiring 2026 graduates with strong problem solving and backend web development skills.",
  "location": "Bangalore / Hybrid",
  "salary": "INR 9,50,000 / year",
  "job_type": "Full-time",
  "deadline": "2026-12-31",
  "min_cgpa": 7.50,
  "max_backlogs": 0,
  "allowed_departments": "Computer Science & Engineering, Information Technology",
  "is_active": true
}

### Get Single Job by ID (Public)
@sampleJobId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{sampleJobId}}

### Update Job Posting (Role: recruiter, own jobs only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{sampleJobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "min_cgpa": 7.00,
  "salary": "INR 10,00,000 / year"
}

### Delete Job Posting (Role: recruiter own / admin any)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{sampleJobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. APPLICATIONS & PLACEMENT PROCESS (Student & Recruiter)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Student Applies to Drive (Checks CGPA, Backlogs, Department, One-Offer rule)
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications/{{sampleJobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Student Tracks Own Application Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications/my
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Company Views Applicants for their Drive (With student roll number and CGPA)
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications/job/{{sampleJobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}

### Company Shortlists / Selects Candidate (Role: recruiter)
@sampleApplicationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
PUT {{baseUrl}}/applications/{{sampleApplicationId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "selected"
}
